OL,3,GNEWSA'Ask us anything': Mosque opens
OL,4,Adoors to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough's Joint Mosque Council
OL,7,Fsays holding an open day is "more
OL,8,Fnecessary than ever", to help bring
OL,9,Fcohesion among communities.
OL,11,FPeople of all faiths and none are
OL,12,Finvited to the city's biggest mosque,
OL,13,FFaizan-E-Madina, on Gladstone Street,
OL,14,Fon Sunday for the annual event.
OL,16,FAttendees will have the opportunity to
OL,17,Fhave open conversations about Islam,
OL,18,Fobserve prayers and connect with the
OL,19,FMuslim community.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
