OL,3,GNEWSA'Ask us anything': Mosque opens
OL,4,Adoors to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbdul Choudhuri, chairman of the Joint
OL,7,FMosque Council, said: "Our aim is, that
OL,8,Fthe barrier should be broken down,
OL,9,Fpeople should understand we live and
OL,10,Fwork together."
